Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I still... Bernard Arnault
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}is still one of my heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今でも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Bernard Arnaultは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}so I gotta say that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}That's the guy, Louis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺のヒーローなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}そこは言っとく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:05.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}head of LVMH. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:05.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}LVMHのトップだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So I gotta shout out, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}good taste when I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}センスがいいものは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ちゃんと称えないとな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I performed at Bernard Arnault's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}son's wedding, Alexandre Arnault,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Arnaultの息子　Alexandreの結婚式で
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ライブした時に言ったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and I said, man, you know, when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I'm the richest man in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「俺が世界一の金持ちになったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I hope my son is cool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}enough to hang out with Ye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}うちの息子がYeとつるめるくらい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}イケてるといいな」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:20.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:20.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}なるほど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm saying this on stage for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}but I told him afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ステージで言ったんだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}後で本人にも言ったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I said, yo, Bernard, you're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「Bernard、あんたが一番だ」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:28.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Jeff Bezos is commodity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:28.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ジェフ・ベゾスは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:28.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ただの量産品だよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それはお前の意見な
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Jeff Bezos don't have no opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ベゾスには
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}自分の意見がない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}He don't got no taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Jeff Bezos ain't got no taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}センスがないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ベゾスにはセンスがない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You wouldn't ask him to pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}what you want for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}クリスマスプレゼントを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}あいつに選ばせないだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Jeff Bezos can't pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ベゾスには選べないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Would you let Jeff Bezos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}pick your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ベゾスにバッグ選ばせる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know what I'm saying? So he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}just learned how to go to Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あいつはLas Vegasで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:47.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and break the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:47.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}マシンをぶっ壊す方法を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:47.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}覚えただけなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's Amazon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Amazonだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, and they respected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そう、それで評価された
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I came from a Cuban family,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}うちはCuba系の家族だから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I got to represent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}What's up, Cuban people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}レペゼンしないとな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Cubaのみんな、元気か？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, but I'm saying, and by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}it's like, okay, you broke the machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}確かにマシンは壊したけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but Bernard Arnault,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you know what I'm saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Bernard Arnaultは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}it's like, put it like this: you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}こう言えばいいか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}if someone's gonna colonize,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}結局のところ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}誰かに植民地化されるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I would like it to be Bernard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}If I had to deal with a colonizer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Bernardがいい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}支配者と付き合うなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I would deal with it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}being Bernard Arnault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Bernard Arnaultがいいね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Bernard Arnault：LVMHの会長で世界有数の富豪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}LVMH：Louis Vuittonなどを持つ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1266)\fs40}高級ブランドグループ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:19.09,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Alexandre：Bernard Arnaultの息子。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:19.09,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}2021年の結婚式でYeがライブを行った
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:29.09,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1120)\fs40}ジェフ・ベゾス：Amazonの創業者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:52.19,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}マシンをぶっ壊す：スロットマシンで大当たりを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:52.19,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}出すように、仕組みを攻略したというたとえ
